{
  "id": "skill-301",
  "name": "Skill 301 · Descriptions That Trigger",
  "description": "Intermediate skill — the description line is a matching rule, not a summary. How to write one that fires when it should and stays quiet when it should not.",
  "metadata": {
    "category": "tutorial",
    "subcategory": "Skills",
    "language": "agent",
    "level": 301,
    "kind": "skill",
